@startuml
'数据交互时序图'
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram
title 数据交互时序图
<style>
element {
  BackGroundColor: #f0f0f0
}
 sequenceDiagram {
    participant {
      FontColor: #000;
      FontSize: 12;
      FontStyle: normal;
      LineColor: #000;
      HorizontalAlignment: left;
    }
    note {
      FontColor: #000;
      FontSize: 12;
      FontStyle: normal;
    }
    arrow {
      FontColor: black;
      LineColor: black;
    }
  }
</style>
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam sequence right
participant Page [
    = Main
    ----
    聊天UI页面
       1、初始化ChatSession
]
participant Session [
    = ChatSession
    ----
     会话交互处理器
]
participant Conversation [
    =Conversation
    ----
     GenUI对话管理器
]
participant Controller [
    =SurfaceController
    ----
     GenUI控制器
]

participant Adapter [
    =A2uiTransportAdapter
    ----
     GenUI和AI服务之间消息适配器
]
participant Parser [
    =A2uiParserTransformer
    ----
     字符串解析器
]
participant Transport [
    = AiClientTransport
    ----
     Ai客户端消息传输器
]
participant Client [
    = DartanticAiClient
    ----
     GenUI客户端
]
participant Agent [
    = dartantic.Agent
    ----
     代理
]
participant Provider [
    = dartantic.GoogleProvider
    ----
     谷歌Ai提供者
]
participant Orchestrator [
    = DefaultStreamingOrchestrator
    ----
     默认数据流编排器
]
participant ChatModel [
    = GoogleChatModel
    ----
     谷歌Ai模型
]
participant GenerativeService [
    = gl.GenerativeService
    ----
     大型模型多模态内容生成服务
]
participant ContentResponse [
    = GenerateContentResponse
    ----
     大型模型多模态内容生成服务响应对象
]

autonumber 1
Page -> Session++: sendMessage
activate Page
Session -> Transport:sendMessage
activate Transport
Transport -> Client++:sendStream
Client -> Agent++:sendStream
Agent -> Provider:createChatModel:返回GoogleChatModel
Agent ->Orchestrator++:processIteration
Orchestrator -> ChatModel++:sendStream
ChatModel -> GenerativeService++:streamGenerateContent
return 返回GenerateContentResponse
ChatModel -> ContentResponse++:toChatResult
return 返回ChatResult<ChatMessage>
return 返回ChatResult<ChatMessage>
Orchestrator -> Orchestrator:onModelChunk:返回消息块
Orchestrator -> Orchestrator:onConsolidatedMessage:返回合并后的消息
return 返回StreamingIterationResult
return 返回ChatResult<String>数据流
return 返回String数据流
deactivate Transport
Transport -> Adapter:addChunk
activate Adapter
Adapter->Parser:调用addChunk方法触发\n_onData方法解析数据转成事件
activate Parser
Parser->Parser:_onData
Parser->Parser:_processBuffer
Parser->Parser:__emitText
group 22.1 文本消息
    autonumber 22.1
    Parser -> Adapter:将文本添加到_pipeline
    autonumber 22.1.1
    Adapter -> Conversation:触发_textSubscription订阅，发送ConversationEvent事件
    activate Conversation
end
group 22.2 A2ui消息
    autonumber 22.2
    Parser ->Parser:_emitMessage
    autonumber 22.2.1
    Parser ->Adapter:触发_pipeline.listen更新_messageStream
    deactivate Parser
    autonumber 22.2.2
    Adapter -> Conversation:触发_transportSubscription订阅
     deactivate Adapter
    autonumber 22.2.3
    Conversation-> Controller:handleMessage
    activate Controller
    autonumber 22.2.4
    Controller -> Controller:_handleMessageInternal更新_registry
    autonumber 22.2.5
    Controller -> Controller:_registry.updateSurface/removeSurface更新_registry
    autonumber 22.2.6
    Controller -> Controller:_registry.events:返回SurfaceUpdate类型
    autonumber 22.2.7
    Controller -> Conversation:触发_engineSubscription订阅
    deactivate Controller
    autonumber 22.2.8
    Conversation -> Conversation:发送ConversationEvent事件
end
autonumber 23
Conversation-> Session:触发_uiConversation.events.listen
deactivate Conversation
Session -> Session:_conversation.events.listen接收ConversationEvent事件
Session -> Session:_messages:更新UI
Session -> Page:更新messages
deactivate Session
deactivate Page
note over Page :更新UI

@enduml


@startuml
'UI渲染时序图'
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram
<style>
element {
  BackGroundColor: #f0f0f0
}
 sequenceDiagram {
    participant {
      FontColor: #000;
      FontSize: 12;
      FontStyle: normal;
      LineColor: #000;
      HorizontalAlignment: left;
    }
    note {
      FontColor: #000;
      FontSize: 12;
      FontStyle: normal;
    }
    arrow {
      FontColor: black;
      LineColor: black;
    }
  }
</style>
title UI渲染时序图
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
participant Main [
    =Main
    ----
    聊天列表
]
participant MessageView [
    =MessageView
    ----
    对话内容视图
]
participant ChatMessageView [
    =ChatMessageView
    ----
    文本消息
]
participant Surface [
    =Surface
    ----
    组件渲染
]
participant Catalog [
    =Catalog
    ----
    组件集合
]
participant CatalogItem [
    =CatalogItem
    ----
    组件声明
]
participant CatalogItemContext [
    =CatalogItemContext
    ----
    组件上下文
]
Main ->MessageView++:初始化
MessageView ->MessageView: build
MessageView -> ChatMessageView++:构建用户消息或者模型纯文本消息
return Widget
MessageView ->Surface++:构建Surface动态界面的控件
Surface -> Surface:_findCatalogForDefinition:获取root组件Catalog
group 组件构建并递归构建子组件
    Surface -> Surface: _buildWidget
    Surface -> Catalog++:buildWidget：根据组件定义类型（type）获取组件
    Catalog -> CatalogItem ++:widgetBuilder:构建对应组件
    CatalogItem -> CatalogItemContext ++ :buildChild:构建子组件
    CatalogItemContext -> Surface:_buildWidget
end
return Widget
return Widget
return Widget
return Widget
return Widget
@enduml